<h1>Viewport Context Menu - Inspection Mode</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-US">The</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Viewport Context</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">menu is the same one as in the main editing mode with one particularity:</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US">If the</span> <span class="Mode" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Inspection</u></span> <span lang="EN-US">mode is entered with compared entity sampled with value different from 100%, this entity will be displayed in Large points render. In this case all the rendering mode options in the viewport context menu will be disabled.</span></p>
